{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Holiday Motel Simulator</i>, you start with peeling paint, broken sinks, and plenty of guest complaints \u2014 and turn it all into a cozy, five-star experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1750149112\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean, renovate, and redesign every corner of your motel, from water-damaged rooms to rusty pipes and worn-out furniture. Use your creativity and a wide range of decorations to give each room a unique vibe \u2014 go rustic, retro, or modern minimalist. It\u2019s up to you to create spaces that guests won\u2019t want to leave.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750149112\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the paint\u2019s dry, it\u2019s time to manage the business. Set prices, take care of bookings, respond to guest feedback, and keep everything running smoothly. Every decision counts \u2014 happy customers mean better reviews, and better reviews mean more bookings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1750149112\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From fixing leaky faucets to decorating dream suites, every detail matters. Will your motel become the next hidden gem on the map? The keys are in your hands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2812420?t=1750149112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/5e65a4ccc5af0008f856f02af8fdb4c9c4fd5dfc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750149112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/68b27